    "title": "Toronto Residents Invited to NMMA Canada's Industry Breakfast at 2026 Boat Show - NewsBreak",
    "text": "51 minutes ago The annual NMMA Canada State of the Industry Breakfast will take place on January 2, 2026, from 8:30 a.m. to 11 a.m. at the Beanfield Centre, Exhibition Place, during the Toronto International Boat Show. Nicole Cervi, Economist at Wells Fargo, will deliver the keynote address. The event will also include the presentation of the 2026 NMMA Canada Hall of Fame award.\nThe event is intended for professionals in the recreational boating industry to network, learn about industry trends, and recognize achievements. For more information, contact Sylvie Quenneville, Manager of Member Services.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
